{
  "slug": "tap",
  "name": "Tap",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-model AI agent communication protocol. Connect Claude, Codex, and Gemini agents through a shared file-based messaging layer. Features include: control tower orchestration, cross-model code review routing, broadcast/DM/CC messaging, agent heartbeat monitoring, mission tracking with kanban board, web GUI dashboard, and generational knowledge transfer through retros, letters, and findings.\n\nOther tools give agents instructions. tap gives them context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **4 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `autopilot` (Control tower autonomous loop — monitors agents, routes reviews, updates missions, detects round completion), `tap` (tap — Multi-session control tower)\n- **Commands** (4): `autopilot` (Control tower autonomous loop — review-routing/status loop with CHAIN integration), `findings` (List all out-of-scope findings from agents, grouped by type), `inbox` (Check the tap comms inbox for new messages, reviews, and findings), `tap` (Multi-session orchestration control tower)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tap@claude-community` from `HUA-Labs/tap`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "HUA Labs"
  },
